__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CONFIDENTIAL — never commit
#
# This repository is PUBLIC (GitHub Pages). PM Pediatrics board-portal exports
# are confidential company information and, for a board member, potentially
# material non-public information. A commit that touches them is public
# permanently: git history, forks and caches all retain it, and reverting does
# not undo that.
#
# Everything below stays on the local machine. The private ingest writes only
# here; nothing under private/ is ever read by the published dashboard.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
private/
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv
!data/**/*.json
